{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56092","headline":"通玄赞八首 七 · 杜光庭","name":"通玄赞八首 七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三千分世界，五亿化诸天。\n一一开净域，方方有圣缘。\n九光生院草，七宝满池莲。\n行馆排朱日，飞台映紫泉。\n烧香皆玉女，说法尽神仙。\n梵引九啸凤，鑪飘五色烟。\n稽首虚皇阙，歌咏太上前。\n慎莫忽宿命，当须信福田。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜光庭","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56092.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56092","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}